nse [Alpha 1.21]","desc":"Bugs have reclaimed the Earth, forcing humanity to take refuge on fragile floating ships above the devastation. Ground colonies now cry out for salvation, summoning you to gather towers to stem the relentless swarm. \n\nUPDATES EVERY 2 WEEKS!\n\n\n💸 Use code \"30K\" for rewards! \n❗ Next code at 40K LIKES!\n\n🌀 Enter one of the platforms to descend to the ground below.\n⚔️ Place towers to defend the village from waves of bugs!\n🎉 Buy crates from the traveling salesman to unlock new cards, new defenders.\n\n🪙 Premium players get double cash while in the Inner Ship AFK room!\n🤝 Join the Stud TD community server for codes and announcements!\n\nSince this game is currently in alpha, please report any bugs (or suggestions) to our community server. We would really appreciate your help!\n\nKeybinds:\nR: Upgrade\nF: Switch Targeting\nV: Sell\nT: Toggle Increased Game Speed\n1-9: Place Tower\n\nMade by Vansmena and ChickenGOD4","path":"/game/126273633980561-stud-tower-defense","slug":"126273633980561-stud-tower-defense","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ca4cd50ffc38b3234fe89f220f6567ea201593bfe853102e4c514216c3621738.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f8849004db15b91a26231eaefb331e5e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":19723100,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-26T06:11:46.576Z","creator":{"name":"Otis Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":120282637490199,"name":"Don't Wake the Spooky Brainrots ","desc":"Shh... Don't wake the Spooky Brainrots!! 🎃👻\n\nTry to snatch brainrots while the SPOOKY Brainrots sleep! 😴\nRun away if you wake them up!🏃‍♂️\nLevel up your brainrots and become OP!\n\n*If you run into bugs, report them below 👇*","path":"/game/120282637490199-don-t-wake-the-spooky-brainrots","slug":"120282637490199-don-t-wake-the-spooky-brainrots","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b20aac55dd234e74462ce700024be4bfa0df951af242f85c153d836a6c9df6